OL,3,GNEWSAOlympian encourages weightlifting
OL,4,Aduring menopause
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlympian Sally Gunnell is working with
OL,7,Fa number of famous faces on a charity
OL,8,Fcampaign designed to get women
OL,9,Fweightlifting, particularly as they
OL,10,Fapproach menopause.
OL,12,FDuring Menopause Awareness Month, the
OL,13,Fgold medalist, who lives near Brighton,
OL,14,Fis involved in the British Heart
OL,15,FFoundation (BHF) 31-day Strong Woman
OL,16,FChallenge.
OL,18,FNew research from the BHF suggests many
OL,19,Fwomen in midlife are not aware that
OL,20,Fperimenopause and menopause can lead to
OL,21,Ffaster muscle loss, and Gunnell is keen
OL,22,Fto get these women lifting.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
