OL,3,GNEWSAOlympian encourages weightlifting
OL,4,Aduring menopause
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe told BBC Radio Sussex: "If we can
OL,7,Finvest in keeping our muscles strong
OL,8,Fand our bones strong in our 50s, 60s,
OL,9,Fand 70s we can still walk up that hill,
OL,10,Fwe can still play with the grandkids."
